323 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The World Certification Industry Association \(WIA\) was established in Estonia on April 19, 2018 to create a transparent world and benefit the world. To this day, the Association continues to evolve with two important missions: to protect the Earth's environment and to create a better future.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
324 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The first is to combat environmental changes caused by global warming. The World Certification Industry Association \(WIA\) is exploring ways to use microalgae to reduce the effects of global warming and increase ecosystem diversity. Microalgae are nature's amazing purification systems and play a key role in responding to the Earth's climate crisis caused by greenhouse gas emissions.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
325 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (WIA is using microalgae, a bio-resource, to not only reduce greenhouse gases and promote ecosystem diversity, but is also leading global carbon neutrality efforts.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
326 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (To this end, WIA focusing on ecosystem restoration, environmental purification, and eco-friendly bio biological resource production projects using microalgae, which greatly contributes to the carbon neutral policy to overcome the Earth's climate crisis. Furthermore, the World Certification Industry Association is an important partner in the global effort toward carbon neutrality, supporting strategies such as carbon emissions trading and the introduction of carbon border taxes, which aim to reduce carbon emissions globally.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
327 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 248 0 R
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
328 0 obj
<<
