/Pg 11 0 R
>>
endobj
330 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Background)
/E (Background)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
331 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (These efforts are linked to global initiatives such as carbon neutrality, carbon credits, and carbon border taxes, contributing to achieving carbon emissions reduction goals in the international community. Through this, WIA is playing a leading role not only in protecting the global environment but also in preparing measures to respond to international carbon emissions regulations.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
332 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (WIA's activities go beyond efforts to protect the global environment and achieve sustainable development, and present specific and practical measures to achieve the global goal of carbon neutrality. The association plays an important role as part of a global community working to reduce carbon emissions and protect the future of our planet.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
333 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The second mission is to establish the WIA Global Education Center to foster professional manpower needed in each industry through the WIA International Qualification Test. Through this training center, the association seeks to realize environmental protection while simultaneously developing the industry by nurturing experts who will lead sustainable development.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
334 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In addition, through WIA Land, the WIA International Qualification Test AI certification and carbon neutral platform, the World Certification Industry Association \(WIA\) is planning and carrying out a project to establish a WIA Global Education Center and spread the WIA International Qualification Test, ultimately increasing the value of WIA digital assets. The main purpose is to provide WIA Families with opportunities for economic freedom and self-realization. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
335 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The WIA IQTs currently being administered and administered include Internationally Certified Artificial Intelligence Manager \(CAM\), Internationally Certified Digital Asset Manager \(CDM\), Internationally Certified Blockchain Manager \(CBM\), Internationally Certified Metaverse Manager \(CMM\), and Internationally Certified Digital Asset Manager \(CDM\). There are NFT Manager \(CNM\), internationally certified IPFS Manager \(CIM\), internationally certified Safety Education Manager \(CEM\), internationally certified ESG Manager \(ESG\), internationally certified Metapsychological Counselor \(CMC\), and internationally certified WIA Korean Language Proficiency Test. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
