380 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1546 0 R
/ActualText (Representative carbon pricing systems include 1\) Emissions Trading System \(ETS\) and 2\) carbon tax. Among these, the emissions trading system can be seen as the most representative carbon pricing system. The emissions trading system has established itself as a representative carbon pricing system due to its lower resistance to policy than the carbon tax, its advantage in securing carbon price fairness, and its potential for international linkage.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
381 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Data source: MERITZ Strategy Daily Strategy Empathy 2.0)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
382 0 obj
<<
