/T (Attendance Quiz Rewards: When members sign up for WIA Land, they receive 5,000 WIA Land as a sign-up bonus. Members have the opportunity to earn up to 30 credits each day \(maximum 0.2 per day\) by answering 5 questions correctly on the WIA International Qualification Exam. These quizzes are updated 24 hours a day \(Korean standard\) and are used for 30 credits \(including 2 ethics credits\) that require recertification every two years.)
/E (Attendance Quiz Rewards: When members sign up for WIA Land, they receive 5,000 WIA Land as a sign-up bonus. Members have the opportunity to earn up to 30 credits each day \(maximum 0.2 per day\) by answering 5 questions correctly on the WIA International Qualification Exam. These quizzes are updated 24 hours a day \(Korean standard\) and are used for 30 credits \(including 2 ethics credits\) that require recertification every two years.)
