/T (Credit is awarded to those who answer the first and fifth questions correctly \(100% correct answer rate\). WIA Daily is provided at 0.2% \(compounded interest\) of the previous day's WIA Land value, and depending on the correct answer to the first question, 80% of the Daily is given as WIA Net-zero and 20% is given as WIA Learning.)
/E (Credit is awarded to those who answer the first and fifth questions correctly \(100% correct answer rate\). WIA Daily is provided at 0.2% \(compounded interest\) of the previous day's WIA Land value, and depending on the correct answer to the first question, 80% of the Daily is given as WIA Net-zero and 20% is given as WIA Learning.)
