982 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (If the value of WIA Net-Zero exceeds 50, WIA Net-Zero is converted to twice the value through the function key of the Convert to WIA Land icon and added to WIA Land. Since the benefits of WIA Family vary depending on the level of WIA Land, WIA Land members can increase WIA Learning, which is a resource for WIA Points, through daily attendance quizzes without burden.   In addition, for sustainability, when financial resources are insufficient, the distribution ratio of WIA Coin is used for the WIA qualification test fee.)
