1060 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (WIA entering the era of cryptocurrency, which was designed to solve the shortcomings of traditional fiat currency. However, establishing intrinsic value to ensure stability and trust remains a challenge. This is where WIA Coin stands out.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1061 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (WIA Coin is not just another cryptocurrency; it is backed by tangible value. In particular, access to online and offline educational services and the prestigious WIA International Qualification Test are evidence of this. This means that WIA Coin holders are not simply investing in a digital asset, but rather investing in their future with real-world training and certification benefits.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1062 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Moreover, WIA Coin offers a unique advantage of stability. By tying the coin's value to its education and certification services, WIA Coin is able to maintain stable pricing, a significant advantage in the volatile world of cryptocurrency. This stability is further strengthened as the utility and demand for WIA Coin increases as the number of participants seeking quality education and certification increases.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1063 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (But why should traditional cash payers consider WIA Coin? Unlike fiat currencies, which are prone to inflation and devaluation over time, WIA Coin offers opportunities for growth. Holders will benefit not only from educational services but also from the model of the WIA ecosystem. If you pass the WIA International Qualification Examination, you will receive 30% of the test fee as operating profit of the WIA Global Education Center, and 20% of the test fee compensation will be shared with participants, contributing to the continuous appreciation of WIA Coin.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1064 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText <>
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
