/S /P
/ActualText (However, WIA Coin does not settle down and introduces you to an evolving ecosystem. )
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1068 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (If education is about 100 years, what about our environment? )
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1069 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (To resolve these concerns, we have implemented the WIA carbon point system.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1070 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText <>
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1071 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (It is not difficult to verify this. WIA Coin \(formerly CBM\), which was listed on Korea's Coredocs exchange on February 5, 2021, started at 10 won at the beginning of listing, and three years later, in February 2024, it averaged 100 won, resulting in a 10-fold increase in the value of WIA Coin. is proving.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
