/ActualText <>
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1073 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (As WIA Coin's ecosystem evolves, integrating the 'WIA Carbon Point' system will not only strengthen its intrinsic value, but also contribute to a sustainable global economy. This pioneering approach will secure WIA Coin's position as a desirable asset for those seeking to make a meaningful impact, both financially and environmentally.)
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [7]
>>
