1118 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We welcome users from around the world to share the WIA white paper. The evolution of the WIA ecosystem represents a journey of innovation and commitment from small beginnings to its current status. The groundbreaking launch of the Certified Blockchain Manager \(CBM\) exam on August 31, 2019 in South Korea, a global IT leader, sets the stage for a series of international qualifications. Continuing to provide CMM, CNM, CIM, CDM, etc., and even the recent WIA Korean Language Proficiency Test, WIA has provided a beacon of hope and success to many people facing adversity amidst the challenges posed by COVID-19 that no one wanted.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1119 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (This victory gave me the courage to explore unknown territories thanks to the encouragement and support of the global community. I am truly grateful to everyone who has participated in this journey. Our mission goes beyond providing qualifications, it is to empower the WIA Family with economic independence and self-fulfillment. I am committed to supporting each individual in their pursuit of excellence within the WIA ecosystem.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1120 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Meeting each of you was a memorable chapter in our story, filled with precious experiences and shared successes. Recognizing that visibility exists in places that are readily seen as well as those that are less visible, I am committed to being by your side every step of your journey.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
